            Most sites launch within 2–4 weeks of kickoff, depending on content &amp; feedback.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow border border-gray-100 p-6">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-semibold mb-2 text-heading">
            Can you help with local SEO or Google rankings?
